<file path="F008.md">
F008 Stores monster stats. Like the other F0xx resources, it probably stores data for the world model. 

There are 128 16-byte records. 

Because of confusion relating to the stat list below, it is uncertain which of the main stats is which. 


|_Field_ | _Type_ | _Description_|
|-|-|-|
|body | uint8 | One of the three main stats.|
|reflex | uint8 | One of the three main stats.|
|mind | uint8 | One of the three main stats.|
|armor | uint8 | |
|unknown1 | uint8 | probably size|
|hp | uint8 | |
|unknown2 | uint32? | Often has single-bit values, might be to do with animation/aspects|
|special_flags | uint16 | Values remain to be elucidated.|
|prop_type | uint16 | The prop type of the monster.|
|corpse_type | uint16 | aspect-prop of the corpse to leave.|





