<file path="F010.md">
This resource contains 0x2000 (8192) 2-byte records. Each record contains a six-bit aspect and ten-bit prop ID. The records are indexed by tile ID, and their purpose is to relate tiles to the faux props drawn on them. A value of 0x0000 indicates that the tile does not have an associated faux prop.
</file>

